<title>SPAIN: SWIMMING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP MEDALS TABLE.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP MEDALS TABLE.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE, Spain 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medals table on the</p>
<p>seventh day of the 12-day European swimming championships on</p>
<p>Tuesday:</p>
<p>		   Gold    Silver    Bronze</p>
<p> Russia	   9	  3	   -</p>
<p> Germany	  7	  4	   4</p>
<p> Hungary	  1	  1	   2</p>
<p> Belarus	  1	  -	   -</p>
<p> Britain	  1	  -	   -</p>
<p> Ireland	  1	  -	   -</p>
<p> France	   -	  5	   -</p>
<p> Italy	    -	  3	   5</p>
<p> Ukraine	  -	  2	   1</p>
<p> Spain	    -	  1	   1</p>
<p> Sweden	   -	  1	   1</p>
<p> Slovakia	 -	  1	   -</p>
<p> Czech Republic -	  -	   2</p>
<p> Austria	  -	  -	   1</p>
<p> Denmark	  -	  -	   1</p>
<p> Netherlands    -	  -	   1</p>
<p>Note: Two silver medals and no bronze were awarded in the</p>
<p>men's 25-kilometre long-distance race.</p>
</text>
